course: dictionary
lesson: 10251
title: Tomcat and other cat words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A tomcat is a male cat, and tom is a short name for it. Context helps you check this. «The old tomcat sat on the garden wall and watched the birds.» The sentence is about a cat, and the word "tomcat" fits best as a male cat.
explain: Read the words around a new word for clues. «A stray tomcat came into the kitchen, hungry and wet from the rain.» Stray means it has no home or owner. Try your meaning in the sentence: "a male cat with no home came into the kitchen" still makes sense, so you have it.
explain: Cats have different words for each sex and age: a male is a tomcat or tom, a female is a queen, and a baby is a kitten. Knowing these words helps you read nature books and pet guides.
fact: A tomcat is a male cat, and tom is a short word for it.
fact: «A stray tomcat» means a male cat with no owner or home.
fact: «An old tomcat» means an adult male cat that has lived for a long time.
fact: In old, informal use, a tomcat can also mean a man who chases after many women. This meaning is old-fashioned, so it is not used for real cats.
fact: In Ukrainian, a tomcat is «kit», which sounds like the English word kit. A she-cat is «kishka».
exercise: «The old tomcat sat on the garden wall.» What is a tomcat? | A female cat | A kind of dog | *A male cat | A baby cat
exercise: «A stray tomcat came into the kitchen.» What does stray mean here? | *Lost, with no owner or home | Loud and hungry | Very fast and clever | Very old and sleepy
exercise: Which word is a short name for a male cat? | Pony | Kitten | *Tom | Queen
test: In Ukrainian pet words, what is the word for a tomcat? | pes | kishka | kotyk | *kit
test: Which word means a baby cat? | Tomcat | *Kitten | Tom | Queen
exam: «The old tomcat fought other cats at night.» Which word means a male cat? | Queen | Kitten | Pony | *Tom
